<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":2,"style":{"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"0","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|superbspacing-xsmall"}}},"fontSize":"superbfont-xlarge"} -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-superbfont-xlarge-font-size" style="margin-top:0;margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--superbspacing-xsmall)"><?php echo esc_html__('A notebook that got out of hand', 'the-family-blog'); ?></h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"contrast-dark","fontSize":"superbfont-small"} -->
<p class="has-contrast-dark-color has-text-color has-superbfont-small-font-size"><?php echo esc_html__('I began writing these entries in a lined notebook the winter our eldest was ten months old, because the days were long and I could already feel them going. The notebook filled. Then another. Somewhere around the fourth I moved it here, mostly so my sister could read it from two hundred miles away.', 'the-family-blog'); ?></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"contrast-dark","fontSize":"superbfont-small"} -->
<p class="has-contrast-dark-color has-text-color has-superbfont-small-font-size"><?php echo esc_html__('There are two children now, and a house we bought in nine days that is further out of town than either of us meant. We homeschool at the kitchen table, badly on Tuesdays, well enough the rest of the week. Most mornings I write for twenty minutes before anyone else is up. That is the whole method.', 'the-family-blog'); ?></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading {"level":3,"style":{"spacing":{"margin":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|superbspacing-small","bottom":"0"}}},"fontSize":"superbfont-medium"} -->
<h3 class="wp-block-heading has-superbfont-medium-font-size" style="margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--superbspacing-small);margin-bottom:0"><?php echo esc_html__('What you will find here', 'the-family-blog'); ?></h3>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"contrast-dark","fontSize":"superbfont-small"} -->
<p class="has-contrast-dark-color has-text-color has-superbfont-small-font-size"><?php echo esc_html__('Weekday hours, mostly. What actually gets eaten. The half hour between homework and supper that I have stopped trying to organise. Slow trips with one bag and low expectations. Six years of lessons at a table that is also where we peel potatoes.', 'the-family-blog'); ?></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"contrast-dark","fontSize":"superbfont-small"} -->
<p class="has-contrast-dark-color has-text-color has-superbfont-small-font-size"><?php echo esc_html__('What you will not find is advice. I am not qualified to give any and I have changed my mind about most of it twice. There is nothing to buy, no course, no printable planner. If something here is useful to you, that is a happy accident rather than the point.', 'the-family-blog'); ?></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:quote -->
<blockquote class="wp-block-quote"><!-- wp:paragraph {"style":{"typography":{"fontStyle":"italic","fontWeight":"400"}},"textColor":"mono-1","fontSize":"superbfont-medium","fontFamily":"fontprimary"} -->
<p class="has-mono-1-color has-text-color has-fontprimary-font-family has-superbfont-medium-font-size" style="font-style:italic;font-weight:400"><?php echo esc_html__('Write it down while it is still warm. You will not remember the morning, only that there was one.', 'the-family-blog'); ?></p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph --></blockquote>
<!-- /wp:quote -->

<!-- wp:paragraph {"textColor":"contrast-dark","fontSize":"superbfont-small"} -->
<p class="has-contrast-dark-color has-text-color has-superbfont-small-font-size"><?php echo esc_html__('Names have been kept, faces have not. The children are old enough now to have opinions about being written about, so anything that is properly theirs stays in the paper notebook where it started.', 'the-family-blog'); ?></p>
